from the author's own earlier in-house reference project. No third-party SDK,
no vendor SDK, and no reverse-engineered proprietary library code is included.

All third-party dependencies are declared in app/build.gradle.kts and are
obtained from Google Maven / Maven Central under their own licenses.

Body-composition values are computed from published population-level formulas
(Deurenberg, Mifflin-St Jeor, Devine). They are estimates, not measurements,
and are not intended for medical diagnosis. See docs/04-身体指标与数据库.md.
